  "2026-10-22T16:32:12.929Z",codex-agent,"Implemented PRRT_kwDOSZpl5M6vRcX7 with kind-scoped SDK dependency deltas. Read the current item immediately before constructing link-step options, add only new blocked_by targets and remove only obsolete targets with explicit kind=blocked_by selectors. Other kinds and retained blocker records are never rebuilt, so timestamps, author and provenance are preserved. Regression reads authoritative stored metadata through public SDK locateItem/readLocatedItem, verifies related and verifies edges (including a related edge sharing a removed blocker target), and exercises adding, replacing and clearing all blockers. This is stronger than rebuilding a merged whole collection; the pinned SDK rejects empty replaceDeps and whole replacements reconstruct records. No clearDeps or replaceDeps remains in reconciliation."
